{"skill":{"slug":"crawl4ai-skill","displayName":"Crawl4ai Skill"},"version":{"version":"1.0.10","createdAt":1773206160408,"changelog":"**Crawl4AI Skill 1.1.0 — Bilingual, Expanded Doc, and Dynamic Scraping**\n\n- Major rewrite of documentation for improved clarity; now fully bilingual (English & Chinese).\n- Expanded feature list to highlight DuckDuckGo search, full-site crawling, dynamic page (JavaScript) scraping, and LLM-optimized outputs.\n- Added command examples and use cases for both static and dynamic web pages.\n- More tags introduced for better discoverability (e.g., spider, crawler, 爬虫).\n- Added comparison and value proposition section: free, no API key, smart extraction, dynamic content support.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4469,"sha256":"a926ed2c033de82e29d2269e5bb795c717842d5420340f3f71e318fec309ad0c","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2104,"sha256":"335a18812673afe1b941094224661f244348a23a597a1f4f42ca4e63b2fd834f","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789139305263,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"2b1d0d698cf24d38d44264b8dd21a07ca9e7c99e8c260c96fddd511d3510e37e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/2b1d0d698cf24d38d44264b8dd21a07ca9e7c99e8c260c96fddd511d3510e37e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085858035},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789139305263},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward web crawling/search wrapper, with expected network crawling behavior and no evidence of hidden persistence, credential handling, or destructive actions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The requested capabilities are proportionate for a crawler/search tool: network access, page rendering, and optional output file writing are expected for the advertised functionality.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation is a plain unpinned PyPI command, `pip install crawl4ai-skill`, which is common but means the reviewed Markdown does not pin the exact package code or transitive dependencies that will run.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill documents broad crawling controls such as max pages, depth, delays, and output files, but does not include explicit user guidance about robots.txt, site terms, privacy, copyright, or rate limiting.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact shows no instructions for persistence, privilege escalation, background services, memory modification, credential/session access, or tool hijacking.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is web search, single-page scraping, site crawling, and JavaScript-rendered page scraping; the documented commands and examples align with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install and run this in a virtual environment or container when possible, avoid elevated privileges, and apply normal scraping controls: respect site terms, robots.txt, privacy boundaries, copyright, and conservative rate/page limits. Consider pinning a reviewed package version before production use.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The crawler and scraper capabilities are purpose-aligned, but the scanner's compliance-warning concern is valid as a documentation gap rather than evidence of malicious or hidden behavior.\n[T08] expected: The unpinned PyPI installation is a real supply-chain consideration, but the artifact does not show malicious dependency use, obfuscation, persistence, or privilege escalation.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789139305263}}}}}